### FilmFuse core-api - recommendation sessions, votes, refresh, pick
# Token: see me.http; groups in groups.http. Sessions are visible to their members only (404 otherwise).
# Without ML_SERVICE_URL, results come from the in-process FallbackRanker ("Popular pick", scores 5.0)
# over the eligible movies already in the cache (browse /movies first so there is something to rank;
# movie details also bring certifications and content levels).
# After each vote / refresh / pick core-api broadcasts `session_updated` on private Realtime topic
# session:<id> (mock gateway without SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY - watch the log).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = paste-access-token-here
@otherToken = paste-second-access-token-here
@otherUserId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@groupId = paste-group-id-here
@sessionId = paste-session-id-here
@movieId = 603

### Group session (201): the group's ACTIVE members, filtered by everyone's comfort + the group cap
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "groupId": "{{groupId}}",
  "filters": {"maxRuntime": 150, "minYear": 1990, "genreIds": [35, 878]},
  "strategy": "LEAST_MISERY"
}

### Ad-hoc "tonight" session with friends (you are added automatically)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"memberIds": ["{{otherUserId}}"]}

### Both groupId and memberIds (or neither) -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"groupId": "{{groupId}}", "memberIds": ["{{otherUserId}}"]}

### The session: results (vetoed last), votes, members, effectiveFilter
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{sessionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### My session history, newest first (pass nextCursor back as ?cursor=)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Only one group's sessions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions?groupId={{groupId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Vote UP / DOWN / VETO (replaces your earlier vote). 404 if the movie is not a result; 409 unless OPEN.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{sessionId}}/votes/{{movieId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"vote": "UP"}

### Veto (as the other member)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{sessionId}}/votes/{{movieId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{otherToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"vote": "VETO"}

### Withdraw your vote
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{sessionId}}/votes/{{movieId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### More results: appended, never repeating anything already shown (or vetoed)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{sessionId}}/refresh
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Pick (any member): DECIDED, writes watch_history for every member. 400 if vetoed / not a result.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{sessionId}}/pick
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"movieId": {{movieId}}}
